Project A (C++ / armadillo)
===========================

* calculate the local density of a nuclear system

-> use git, doxygen, make, cxxtest, remark.js, mandatory unit tests

1. prepare the project tree
1. implement the basis functions calculation (mandatory tests)
1. implement the calculation of the R and Z functions (mandatory tests)
1. implement the basis truncation (mandatory tests)
1. implement the local density calculation
1. calculate and plot the local density (2D)
1. optimize the local density calculation
1. present your project

Lectures
--------

* introduction
* project presentation
* git
* zen of C++
* make
* Armadillo
* Doxygen
* CxxTest
* sum optimization

Optional lectures
-----------------

* valgrind
* gdb
* latex
* markdown

